          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.74,
          "end": 71.519,
          "en": "and the transcribed text will be inserted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.559,
          "end": 74.519,
          "en": "into this input box. So of course, I could have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.57900000000001,
          "end": 77.5,
          "en": "also written this manually but if I'm too lazy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.559,
          "end": 80.479,
          "en": "for that or if I can't type, I can use",
