          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.199,
          "end": 153.179,
          "en": "conversation with another human. So let me give you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.199,
          "end": 155.779,
          "en": "a short example here. Okay, so my",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 155.799,
          "end": 158.739,
          "en": "understanding is that the idea behind this voice mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.75900000000001,
          "end": 161.099,
          "en": "is that we can have, like, a human to human",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 161.159,
          "end": 163.959,
          "en": "conversation and I don't really see the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.039,
          "end": 166.359,
          "en": "that's generated behind the scenes. Is that true?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.75900000000001,
          "end": 170.279,
          "en": "Yeah, that's right. The idea is to make our",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.31900000000002,
          "end": 172.97899999999998,
          "en": "interaction feel more like a natural conversation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.31900000000002,
          "end": 174.899,
          "en": "similar to chatting with another person.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.359,
          "end": 178.25900000000001,
          "en": "Instead of reading text, you just listen to the responses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.459,
          "end": 180.859,
          "en": "which can make it feel more personal and engaging.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 183.219,
          "end": 185.679,
          "en": "So now, of course, you can always end that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.859,
          "end": 188.179,
          "en": "mode and then you will see the",
          "zh": ""
        },
