          "end": 193.719,
          "en": "recording this, you can't edit your original",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.819,
          "end": 196.179,
          "en": "prompt though. You can just see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 197.099,
          "end": 199.779,
          "en": "And you also can't regenerate the responses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 199.899,
          "end": 201.799,
          "en": "though that might change in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 202.699,
          "end": 205.599,
          "en": "You can still edit it in Canvas, again, that's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 205.599,
          "end": 208.379,
          "en": "something we'll explore later, and replay it to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 208.439,
          "end": 210.559,
          "en": "have the AI read it out to you again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.579,
          "end": 214.499,
          "en": "But this voice mode therefore is of course quite interesting if you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.539,
          "end": 217.519,
