        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.639,
          "end": 223.399,
          "en": "Though to be very honest, most of us will",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 223.439,
          "end": 226.379,
          "en": "probably use the normal mode most of the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 226.399,
          "end": 229.339,
          "en": "time but it's good to know about this voice mode which",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 229.379,
